@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.rsdrp_r = Q.rsdrp_votes;
Q.otherleft_r = Q.otherleft_votes;
Q.psr_r = Q.psr_votes;
Q.plsr_r = Q.plsr_votes;
Q.rkp_r = Q.rkp_votes;
Q.musavat_r = Q.musavat_votes;
Q.kadets_r = Q.kadets_votes;
Q.vs_r = Q.vs_votes;
Q.nts_r = Q.nts_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the NTS or the RSDRP.
Q.largest_party = 'RSDRP';
if (Q.nts_r >= Q.rsdrp_r && Q.nts_r >= Q.rkp_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'NTS';
}
if (Q.rkp_r >= Q.rsdrp_r && Q.rkp_r >= Q.nts_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'RKP';
}

// coalitions
Q.trudovaya_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.otherleft_r + Q.psr_r;
Q.vremennyy_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.musavat_r + Q.psr_r;
Q.bourgeois_coalition = Q.musavat_r + Q.psr_r + Q.kadets_r + Q.other_r;
Q.center_right_coalition = Q.psr_r + Q.musavat_r + Q.kadets_r + Q.other_r + Q.vs_r;
Q.right_coalition = Q.psr_r + Q.kadets_r + Q.other_r + Q.vs_r;
Q.far_right_coalition = Q.vs_r + Q.nts_r;
Q.left_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.plsr_r + Q.rkp_r;
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.united_front_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.rkp_r + Q.plsr_r + Q.psr_r + Q.musavat_r;
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.rkp_r + Q.nts_r;
Q.noway_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.nts_r;
// aka everyone except nazi, rkp, vs
Q.neo_trudovaya_coalition = Q.rsdrp_r + Q.musavat_r + Q.psr_r + Q.kadets_r + Q.other_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Reichstag seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
RSDRP: [+ rsdrp_r +]

# 1928: 17, 1930: 15, 1932: 10
Other Leftists: [+ otherleft_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 15, 1932: 
PSR: [+ psr_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 15, 1932: 
PLSR: [+ plsr_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 3
RKP: [+ rkp_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as DstP)
Müsavat: [+ musavat_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
K-D: [+ kadets_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
VS: [+ vs_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
NTS: [+ nts_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Trudovaya Coalition (RSDRP + PSR + Other Leftists): [+ trudovaya_coalition +]

Vremennyy Coalition (RSDRP + PSR + Müsavat + K-D): [+ vremennyy_coalition +]

Bourgeois Coalition (PSR + Müsavat + K-D + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]

Right-wing Coalition (PSR + K-D + Others + VS): [+ right_coalition +]

Tsarist-Socialist Coalition (RSDRP + SRN): [+ noway_coalition +]

